			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1419674">
									

<p>Changed that sentence to 'using force within the realistic limits of human strength'.</p>
<p>I didn't visualise it as being compulsory to keep spinning it, I saw it more that you spin it, you don't die of old age. Hence the old guy who has probably used it on and off his whole life is now spinning it constantly because he knows that his time is short. He is not compelled in any supernatural way, he just doesn't want to die. Then it spins under the sofa.</p>
<p>The diary entries are a definite possibility, or I also considered some sort of folk tale passed down generations of his family, either way I wanted to get a short snappy version up and see what people thought would add to it, so thanks for the suggestions.</p>

